  "body": "Summary\nUpdates the operating system documentation to remove the outdated claim that Apache Kafka is tested on Solaris.\n\nThe revised wording preserves the expected compatibility with Unix-like operating systems while accurately stating that Kafka is tested on Linux.\n\nVerification\n* Confirmed that Kafka's GitHub Actions workflows use Ubuntu Linux runners.\n* Inspected a successful JUnit test job running on Ubuntu Linux.\n* Searched the repository for Solaris references and found only the outdated documentation statement.\n* Ran git diff --check successfully.\nChanges\n* Updated one sentence in docs/operations/hardware-and-os.md.\n* No functional or Java code changes.\nJIRA: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-21331\n\nReviewers: Yahya Kisana (github:ykisana)\n",
